  ('curiosity', 'medium', 'lover', 'tip', 'Ask {name} to pick the next date idea. They have preferences, they just don''t always push them.'),
  ('curiosity', 'medium', 'business_partner', 'who', 'is open to new ideas when there''s a good reason'),
  ('curiosity', 'medium', 'business_partner', 'who_they', 'They''re open to new ideas when there''s a good reason'),
