  ('curiosity', 'medium', 'business_partner', 'challenge', '{name} may need a clear reason before joining a new idea, which can feel slow when you''re excited.'),
  ('curiosity', 'medium', 'business_partner', 'tip', 'When you pitch a new idea to {name}, lead with the problem it solves. They join fast once the reason is clear.'),
  ('curiosity', 'medium', 'family', 'who', 'likes some change, but not too much at once'),
  ('curiosity', 'medium', 'family', 'who_they', 'They like some change, but not too much at once'),
