  ('curiosity', 'medium', 'family', 'challenge', '{name} can feel caught between the people who want change and those who want things as they are.'),
  ('curiosity', 'medium', 'family', 'tip', 'Ask {name} for their opinion when the family disagrees about plans. They often find the middle ground.'),
  ('curiosity', 'low', 'lover', 'who', 'is grounded, practical and happy with the simple things'),
