  ('curiosity', 'low', 'lover', 'challenge', '{name} may resist new plans or changes, especially if they come with little warning.'),
  ('curiosity', 'low', 'lover', 'tip', 'Give {name} time to warm up to new ideas. Mention a plan a few days ahead instead of springing it on them.'),
